        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "f44aaa52-aa2c-59ff-b53e-510a5fd204f5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whitney Houston\n- Music Groups: LMC, U2\n- Songs: \"Take Me to the Clouds Above\", \"How Will I Know\", \"With or Without You\"\n- Albums: \"The Joshua Tree\"\n- Places: United Kingdom, Ireland, Australia\n\nFacts:\n- On 16 March 1987, U2 released \"With or Without You\" as the lead single from their fifth studio album \"The Joshua Tree\".\n- In 1987, \"With or Without You\" was the third track on U2's fifth studio album \"The Joshua Tree\".\n- In early 2004, LMC's track \"Take Me to the Clouds Above\" featured samples from Whitney Houston's \"How Will I Know\" and U2's \"With or Without You\".\n- In early 2004, LMC's \"Take Me to the Clouds Above\" topped the UK Singles Chart.\n- In early 2004, LMC's \"Take Me to the Clouds Above\" reached the top 5 in Ireland and the top 10 in Australia.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "5d712a1f-123b-5022-b3e3-a3e4e2dc3cb9",
        "text": "Page: LMC (British band). Sentence: LMC is best known for the track \"Take Me to the Clouds Above\" which featured a sample from \"How Will I Know\" by Whitney Houston, and \"With or Without You\" by U2 which topped the UK Singles Chart in early 2004, as well as going top 5 in Ireland and top 10 in Australia.\nPage: With or Without You. Sentence: It is the third track from their fifth studio album, \"The Joshua Tree\" (1987), and was released as the album's lead single on 16 March 1987.",
